'''Enchanting Mage Vibon''' (魅惑の魔導士ヴィボーン, ''Miwaku no Madōshi Vibōn'', '''Enchanting Mage Vibon''') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]/[[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]] variant of [[Grand Mage Mimon]]. She was added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Enchanting Mage Vibon
|image = E 777.png
|first appearance = [[Fascinating Fallen Tower/Floor 30|魅惑の堕天楼 - Floor 30]]
|money drop = 3,000¢ - 11,850¢
}}

==Enemy==
This dastardly herald's [[Long Distance]] level 3 [[Surge Attack]]s create an area of denial that [[Weaken|Weakens]] all cat units to 50%. If this kit happens to ring a bell, it's because she operates as a souped up version of [[Kasli the Bane (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasli, Daughter of Chaos]].

Her DPS is obscene, completely shredding anything in her way, to the point where not even [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cats]] are able to withstand the sheer brutality of her attacks for very long. There's barely any downtime to launch a counter-attack either, basically forcing you to deal with all threats before you even think about approaching her. In many ways, she's giving the Cat Army a taste of their own medicine.

